meta {
  name: Create Entry
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.EntryService/CreateEntry
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "key": "button.cancel",
    "scopeId": "{{scopeId}}",
    "description": "Cancel button label"
  }
}

docs {
  # Create Entry

  Creates a new translation entry.

  ## Authentication
  Requires valid access token. User ID is automatically tracked as creator.

  ## Request
  - `key` (required): Unique key for the entry (e.g., "button.save")
  - `scopeId` (optional): UUID of scope to associate with this entry
  - `description` (optional): Human-readable description

  ## Behavior
  - Key must be unique across all entries
  - CreatedBy is automatically set from authenticated user
  - Scope association is optional at creation

  ## Response
  Returns the newly created entry.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "entry": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "key": "button.cancel",
      "description": "Cancel button label",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-27T19:05:00+01:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T19:05:00+01:00",
      "createdBy": "user-uuid",
      "localizations": [],
      "scopes": [
        {
          "id": "uuid",
          "name": "Frontend",
          "slug": "frontend"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: entry key is required
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to create entry (e.g., duplicate key)
}
